{"id":"n62675-1-9","stage":1,"title":"서랍 · 抽屉","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62675-1-9-1","ko":"엄마 제 빨간색 셔츠는 어디에 있어요?","zh":"妈妈，我的红色衬衫在哪里呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨간색","meaning":"红色","explanation":"빨간색：红色","readings":[{"term":"빨간색","audio":"/audio/312153cf826c5582fb77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26849","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨간색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"셔츠는","meaning":"衬衫","explanation":"셔츠：衬衫；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"셔츠","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64284","senseId":"1","lemma":"셔츠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"312153cf826c5582","term":"빨간색","zh":"红色","audio":"/audio/312153cf826c5582fb77.mp3","entryId":"26849","definition":"像鲜血、熟透的苹果、辣椒般红红的颜色。","pronunciation":["빨간색"]},{"id":"0f9ab32a190bfc01","term":"셔츠","zh":"衬衫","audio":"/audio/0f9ab32a190bfc019f18.mp3","entryId":"64284","definition":"可穿在西装内，也可外穿的西式上衣。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e9573eb55e01443fc59e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62675-1-9-2","ko":"옷장 두 번째 서랍을 열어 보렴.","zh":"去打开衣柜的第二个抽屉看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옷장","meaning":"衣橱，衣柜","explanation":"옷장：衣橱，衣柜","readings":[{"term":"옷장","audio":"/audio/69d674f79595c850af31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68496","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번째","meaning":"个","explanation":"번：个；째：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"1","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서랍을","meaning":"抽屉","explanation":"서랍：抽屉；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"서랍","audio":"/audio/d726cb646d240fa5bfd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62675","senseId":"1","lemma":"서랍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열어","meaning":"开","explanation":"열다：开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"열다","audio":"/audio/a835c2d2f8006f03ff99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66574","senseId":"1","lemma":"열다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보렴.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","expla